<title>Iraq: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iraq/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iraq-2026-11-25T19:29:15.165Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 19:29:15 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Baghdad is deploying troops to secure Kurdistan borders after the top court authorized a military presence and a takeover of border posts and oil fields, while the prime minister is pressing for greater authority over Kurdish regions. The president is exercising ceremonial military command as the defense ministry orders nationwide troop deployment and closure of oil smuggling routes, and security forces have seized drone launchers and destroyed a militant vehicle in Al-Anbar. Hezbollah fighters have been transferred onto Popular Mobilization Forces payroll, and a KDP delegation is seeking de-escalation in Baghdad talks. The conflict recorded 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizAFBVV95cUxPeGlKWlRMLUx5SDRZY3FLU3VLM19RX2JqVko0T3dBakVEVHVldFVtQ21MbGo2WEEzUXU1clEteTVvWWh3bkdkQzZPX3RSemt5eWlBVjJQZy1RdjNjNnlpT19ZZUd0ekFDc3JuVHZKVWJfX2VtTlBzU3ZTTHlBX3dkV1NNVXA4NmJMVlRGX3FidmJsa0VacW5fQ2E1ZHBZTnJrN2pVc1BkUk1aZVliX2lMdHJBcUFaYlh5WmY3a05aSVZYN1hKemFtTGFUMG0?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxQV0tJbURiRHU3WF85OHFic1Z2OUFGUzRZa3FfdGxhRkhjdDlWY3B2dXFHV21VWEhfam84aTByUXVMSmRGTTRJWk9lZTBIVFlDai10VXE5U1hrUTBGdmFnNTd1Z1hrdlptcWlLY2JicURSbnh6Q1lVazFKTmhCNmNwazFMc0pGblk0cU5KaXktcl9mU29UMjUxdXRB?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxNdFQtVTRNaHQ0VDNsenhqUndQQmNLaDFyMF9uTjhrNXZTY0RUUnVERVJ5SGlRRnlMNlpVclJQb3hjSGZtNTY5RjE3UTlQZnJvUmRyTDU4Nm5rNHVaSTREUmt2Vmd6N21BNEstSENvUWQ0YmdzTFhGS0I1RFFwTWR2VDRUb0I?oc=5&quot;&gt;Financial Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://new